      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 古歌：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01264",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“擅越此神垣，犯禁罪孽深。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "To cross this sacred fence without leave and violate the taboo is a grave sin.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01264",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "只为情所钟，今我不惜身。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet because my heart is bound by love, I no longer care what becomes of me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01264",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "见《拾遗集》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in the Shuishu Collection.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
